      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;beginner-basics--definitions&#34;&gt;Beginner (Basics &amp;amp; Definitions)&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#1-explain-jenkins&#34;&gt;Explain Jenkins?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#2-what-is-the-purpose-of-jenkins&#34;&gt;What is the purpose of Jenkins?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#3-what-is-the-use-of-jenkins-in-automation&#34;&gt;What is the use of Jenkins in automation?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#4-what-is-cicd&#34;&gt;What is CI/CD?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#5-explain-ci-and-cd&#34;&gt;Explain CI and CD?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#6-what-is-a-cicd-pipeline&#34;&gt;What is a CI/CD pipeline?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#7-what-is-the-difference-between-ci-and-cd&#34;&gt;What is the difference between CI and CD?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#8-as-a-tester-how-do-you-use-jenkins&#34;&gt;As a tester, how do you use Jenkins?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#9-have-you-integrated-jenkins-in-your-project&#34;&gt;Have you integrated Jenkins in your project?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;questions-with-answers&#34;&gt;Questions with Answers&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;beginner-basics--definitions-1&#34;&gt;Beginner (Basics &amp;amp; Definitions)&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;explain-jenkins&#34;&gt;Explain Jenkins?&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Answer&lt;/strong&gt;: Jenkins is an open-source automation server that helps automate the parts of software development related to building, testing, and deploying, facilitating &lt;strong&gt;Continuous Integration (CI)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
